<p>The European Union on Thursday formally approved a €90 billion loan for Ukraine for 2026-2027 and adopted its 20th sanctions package against Russia, ending months of internal deadlock after Hungary and Slovakia dropped their vetoes. The breakthrough came after Russian oil flows resumed through the Druzhba pipeline into Slovakia and Hungary following repairs to the section in Ukraine damaged by a Russian strike earlier this year, removing the condition both governments had tied to their approval. For Kyiv, the decision unlocks badly needed financing for economic and military needs as the war enters its fifth year and European officials increasingly signal they are preparing for a prolonged conflict rather than a near-term peace settlement. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky welcomed the move as a strong decision and said Ukraine hopes to receive the first tranche by the end of May or early June, while EU leaders cast the package as proof the bloc can still act in support of Ukraine despite difficult negotiations.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/LVFh7_iEhI7zutXw6V4ZfCGlD3es-gPt2LF4wKork7qnOV7PEULmuWjetHZXHhkRPKRPIMg7qPmXTeSJxLLL7OK-WeA7azOePy-Afvq_ODfGekgaNNq2JTqxTN5Re3SkhVSEKgyI7q7CGyLVdrtG-Ef0pD-Z63ULvm6-1KyYw87I4e1mUCwBPJZhjKgpWx4ceo8h-X-uw8COPtovx4a6LHL7C0KG0-w2pGglFb329zaNPxtmfpr2TiZCkQSiilIlLft8wSNlVwsk' alt='European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen, right, and Ukraine&#x27;s President Volodymyr Zelenskyy participate in a media conference at EU headquarters in Brussels, Sunday, August 17, 2025.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Bank crackdown: The sanctions ban another 20 Russian lenders from euro payments and EU business, bringing the total number of sanctioned Russian banks to 70.</li><li>Evasion targets: The package also sanctions four banks in Kyrgyzstan, Laos and Azerbaijan, bans EU dealings with Russian crypto-exchange firms, and restricts exports of metal-working machines and radio equipment to Kyrgyzstan under the EU’s anti-circumvention tool.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelenskyy: Zelensky called the package a &quot;strong and fundamental decision,&quot; said it would strengthen Ukraine’s army, and pushed to secure the first tranche by the end of May or early June. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-zelensky-says-the-eus-90-billion-loan-is-a-strong-decision/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li><li>European Commission: Commission President Ursula von der Leyen said the EU was &quot;doubling down&quot; on support for Ukraine as Russia escalates, framing the package as both military backing and political resolve. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/eu-approves-e90b-loan-to-ukraine/'>Politico Europe</a>)</li><li>Hungary and Slovakia: Both governments tied their approval of the loan to the restoration of Druzhba oil deliveries, using energy security concerns as leverage during the standoff. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-eu-ukraine-loan-package/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li><li>Analysts cited by The New York Times: The package’s structure, weighted more heavily toward military spending than earlier EU aid, reflects a European judgment that peace is not close and that Ukraine must be financed for a long war. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/23/world/europe/eu-loan-ukraine.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3351197/eu-approves-us106-billion-loan-ukraine-after-hungary-lifts-veto'>EU approves US$106 billion loan to Ukraine after Hungary lifts veto</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/eu-sanction-russia-banks-vladimir-putin-war-economy/'>EU sanctions more Russian banks to squeeze Putin’s war economy</a> - politico.eu</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/eu-formally-approves-ukraine-loan-and-20th-sanctions-package-against-russia'>EU formally approves Ukraine loan and 20th sanctions package against Russia</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-zelensky-says-the-eus-90-billion-loan-is-a-strong-decision/'>Zelensky says the EU&#x27;s €90-billion loan is a &#x27;strong&#x27; decision</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://theweek.com/defence/eu-loan-ukraine-russia-war'>Will €90bn EU loan help Ukraine unlock Russia impasse?</a> - theweek.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/apr/23/is-the-tide-turning-for-ukraine-in-war-with-russia-the-latest'>Is the tide turning for Ukraine in war with Russia? – The Latest</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/23/world/europe/eu-loan-ukraine.html'>$106 Billion Loan Reflects E.U.’s View That Peace in Ukraine Is Far Away</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/ukraine-russia-war-eu-loan-battlefield-drone-attack/33740920.html'>Zelenskyy Says Ukraine&#x27;s War Position &#x27;Most Stable&#x27; In Months As EU Approves Funds</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.allsides.com/news/2026-04-23-0700/energy-eu-approves-eu90-billion-loan-ukraine-after-hungary-lifts-controversial-veto'>EU approves €90 billion loan for Ukraine after Hungary lifts controversial veto</a> - allsides.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638976-eu-approves-ukraine-loan/'>EU approves €90 bn for Ukraine</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/european-unions-wartime-loan-vital-lifeline-cash-strapped-132317879'>Why the European Union&#x27;s wartime loan is a vital lifeline for cash-strapped Ukraine</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/04/23/nx-s1-5795803/after-being-held-up-for-months-ukraine-set-to-get-100b-loan-from-eu'>After being held up for months, Ukraine set to get $100B loan from EU</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/23/eu-gives-final-approval-to-90-billion-loan-for-ukraine_6752752_4.html'>EU gives final approval to €90-billion loan for Ukraine</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1stgv78/breaking_eu_formally_approves_90_billion_euros/'>BREAKING: EU formally approves 90 billion euros Ukraine loan, 20th package of Russia sanctions</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/druzhba-pipeline-restarts-russian-oil-flows-to-europe-unblocking-eu-loan-for-kyiv3'>Druzhba pipeline restarts Russian oil flows to Europe, unblocking EU loan for Kyiv</a> - japantoday.com</li></ul>